Package: hovernet-community-tracks
Version: 0.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: hovernet-game
Maintainer: HoverNet Team <devteam@outiva.com>
Description: HoverNet community track library
 About a thousand community-made tracks from the classic HoverRace library,
 installed unchanged. They appear in HoverNet's track selectors below the
 bundled official tracks. The tracks have no recorded licence; see
 /usr/share/doc/hovernet-community-tracks/README.
